---
import Button from '../../shared/components/Button.astro';
import Interests from './Interests.astro';
---

<section class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">The person behind the projects</p>
  <h1>Hi, I'm Eric.</h1>
  <div class="editorial-grid">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm a systems architect with nine years of software development
        experience before moving into architecture.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like ambitious ideas, clear boundaries, and finding a first version
        that people can actually use. A lot of that curiosity finds its way into
        AI and the tools we use to build things together.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of software, I'm a husband, father, and worship leader. Music,
        good stories, and a meal shared with others all have a place here.
      </p>
      <Button href="/contact/">Say hello ↗</Button>
    </div>
    <Interests />
  </div>
</section>
